WEBVTT

00:13:56.707 --> 00:14:00.878
but we have to understand
and remember that being grateful

00:14:00.919 --> 00:14:04.590
and being treated fairly
are not mutually exclusive.

00:14:04.590 --> 00:14:08.093
I can be grateful but still know
exactly what I deserve.

00:14:08.093 --> 00:14:09.845
And that's the way to do it.

00:14:09.845 --> 00:14:13.181
(Applause)

00:14:13.181 --> 00:14:16.476
Up next, invest in potential.

00:14:16.977 --> 00:14:18.145
When investing in women,

00:14:18.186 --> 00:14:21.315
don’t invest in the 1:30am time slot.

00:14:21.690 --> 00:14:24.192
Invest in empowering something different.

00:14:24.192 --> 00:14:25.485
Invest in a new voice.

00:14:25.527 --> 00:14:28.280
Give them the support they actually need.

00:14:28.322 --> 00:14:31.116
Cultural change takes time and money.